OL,3,GNEWSAHeart transplant recipient
OL,4,Awelcomes baby girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FA GP who was just days from death
OL,7,Fbefore undergoing an emergency heart
OL,8,Ftransplant has given birth to a baby
OL,9,Fgirl.
OL,11,FDr Sanjana Kochhar, from Liverpool,
OL,12,Fsuffered multiple organ failure while
OL,13,Fin hospital in October 2022 and
OL,14,Funderwent a transplant. She was
OL,15,Fdischarged on Christmas Eve that year.
OL,17,FIn August, she welcomed her daughter
OL,18,Fand has since visited a special living
OL,19,Fmemorial bench in Liverpool named in
OL,20,Fher honour by the British Heart
OL,21,FFoundation.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
