OL,3,GNEWSAHeart transplant recipient
OL,4,Awelcomes baby girl
OL,5,
OL,6,FSanjana said the bench was a reminder
OL,7,Fof her journey and she hoped it would
OL,8,Finspire others to talk about heart
OL,9,Fdisease and organ donation.
